```

output:
**No — Buffer Overflow** (CWE-119, CRITICAL)

Use std::string instead of fixed-size char arrays.

The vulnerable pattern is:
```c++
char buf[256];
std::cin >> buf;
```

The safe alternative is:
```c++
std::string buf;
std::cin >> buf;
```

